%% Opening the app: the "while you were away" card replaces notifications.
sequenceDiagram
    participant K as Kids web app
    participant A as Kids API
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    K->>A: GET /api/me/summary
    A->>D: hug receipts, gifts received and endings on my stories since last_summary_seen_at
    A-->>K: {hugs: 5, gifts: 1, endings: 2}
    K->>A: POST /api/me/summary/seen
    A->>D: set last_summary_seen_at = now
